<div style='font-weight:600;font-size:5.4cqw;line-height:1.2;color:#0f172a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Notes</div></div><div style='font-size:3.4cqw;color:#475569;white-space:nowrap'>0 graphs</div></div><div style='margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:26.4cqw;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;border-radius:3cqw;color:#64748b;font-size:3.6cqw'>Nothing here yet. Add a graph with a portal.</div></div></div></div><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/repo-template/shelves/notes/root.node' title='Notes' aria-label='Notes' style='position:absolute;inset:0'></a></div></div></div></div></div>"
